{"metadata":{"subject":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"范畴论","text":"范畴论"}}]},4],"title":[{"Plain":"Barr–Beck–Lurie 定理"},2],"slug":[{"Plain":"Barr–Beck–Lurie定理"},0],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"tag":[{"Plain":"百科"},3],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},5]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2>陈述</h2>\n<h3>经典</h3>\n<p>经典范畴论中的 Barr–Beck 定理如下.</p>\n<p><strong>定理</strong>. 对于函子 $G\\colon \\mathcal D\\to\\mathcal C$, 设有左伴随 $F$, 则 $G$ 为"},{"Local":{"url":"单子性函子","text":"单子性函子"}},{"Plain":"当且仅当 $G$ 反映同构, 且 $G$ "},{"Local":{"url":"创生(范畴论)","text":"创生"}},{"Plain":" $G$-"},{"Local":{"url":"分裂余等化子","text":"分裂余等化子"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<p>具体地, 后一个条件 “创生分裂余等化子” 是说每当有图表</p>\n<p><figure><img src=\"./Barr–Beck-G-split-coequalizer.svg\" class=\"color-invert\"/></figure></p>\n<p>其中 $h\\circ G(f) = h\\circ G(g)$,</p>\n"}]}}